Hi Team,

Please use the link below to access the SharePoint Apps:

https://apps.powerapps.com/play/e/default-3ce358ea-700e-4f0f-bb37-fd0b7c21366c/a/4ea6cb3b-9f90-4149-a723-c0617581d259?tenantId=3ce358ea-700e-4f0f-bb37-fd0b7c21366c&hint=e25e75d1-d5f4-4bfb-bdf6-94f54db160c2&sourcetime=1781659608934

Note:

- To access a specific section in the application, your account must first be registered in the SE Access SharePoint list.
- If your account is not yet registered, you will not be able to access the assigned section.

To open a specific section directly, add the following to the end of the application URL:

"&section=PR%20INK%20Proc"

Example:
"https://apps.powerapps.com/play/...&section=PR%20INK%20Proc"

Creating a Section Parameter

To create a link for another section:

1. Copy the exact section name.
2. Replace every space with "%20".
3. Append it to the end of the URL in the following format:

"&section=SectionName"

Examples:

- PR INK Proc → "&section=PR%20INK%20Proc"
- Warehouse → "&section=Warehouse"
- Quality Assurance → "&section=Quality%20Assurance"
- Production Line 1 → "&section=Production%20Line%201"

If you encounter any access issues, please contact the system administrator to verify that your account has been added to the SE Access list.

Thank you.



